# Everything here is written with LF and read by tools that expect LF -- the Rust
# sources, the Python analysis scripts, and the generated .ini files the kit writes.
# Normalising on checkout would rewrite them to CRLF and make every file look modified.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Nothing in this repository is binary today, but say so for the shapes that turn up
# around a mod: patched executables, packaged releases, extracted content.
*.exe   binary
*.dll   binary
*.zip   binary
*.pickle binary
